Conversation two. say your shop has been doing well.

55
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:07,960
Could you give me some idea of what doing well means in facts and figures?

56
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:14,820
Well, doing well means averaging 1,200 pounds or more a week for

57
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:19,080
making almost a quarter of a million pounds.

58
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,520
And doing well means your earnings are rising.

59
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:29,920
Last year we did slightly over 50,000 and this year we hope to do more than 60,000.

60
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:33,020
So that's good if we continue to rise.

61
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,860
Now that's gross earnings, I assume.

62
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:37,500
What about your expenses?

63
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,400
Yes, that's gross.

64
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:42,160
The expenses, of course, go up steadily.

65
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:47,880
And since we've moved to this new shop, the expenses have increased greatly because

66
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,420
it's a much bigger shop.

67
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:52,960
So I couldn't say exactly what our expenses are.

68
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:58,940
There's something in the region of 6 or 7,000 pounds a year which is not high.

69
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:04,720
Commercially speaking, it's fairly low and we try to keep our expenses as low as we

70
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:09,680
can. And your prices are much lower than the same goods in shops round about.

71
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:15,400
How do the local shopkeepers feel about having a shop doing so well in their midst?

72
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:21,320
Perhaps a lot of them don't realize how well we're doing because we don't make a

73
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,680
point of publicizing.

74
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:27,180
That was a lesson we learned very early on.

75
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:32,360
We were very friendly with all local shopkeepers and we happened to mention to a

76
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:35,560
local shopkeeper how much we had made that week.

77
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:40,040
He was very unhappy and never as friendly again.

78
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:44,900
So we make a point of never publicizing the amount of money we make.

79
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:48,400
But we're on very good terms with all the shops.

80
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:53,320
None of them have ever complained that we're putting them out of business or

81
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,560
anything like that.

82
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:57,220
I think it's a nice friendly relationship.

83
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:02,660
Maybe if they did know what we made, perhaps they wouldn't be so friendly.

